<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρρωδ-έω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dread, shrink from,</i> c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.35
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				831
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				541
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήν τινος μανίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					213d
				</span></i>
			 : c. gen. rei, <i>fear for</i> or <i>because of</i> a
			thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.111
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					28.7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					2.7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τῷ ἐμαυτοῦ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.9
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ θανάτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.2
				</span></i>
			 : folld. by a Relat. clause, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.70
				</span></i>
			 : more freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. μὴ . . ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthphr.</u>
				3a
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως μὴ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.70
			</span></i> : also c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. θανεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					768
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸς ὀ. παθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					130
				</span></i>
			 : abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5.98
			</span></i>.</div>
